{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s5c7be1df2c427753","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-515d1e91cd3b958f024c","text":"いい感じだ{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4a5675641f28005c03c4","text":"いい感じだ{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-07d83c05ba5aba9deec2","text":"あんまりよくない{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-62957de12b17875e0f5b","text":"あんまりよくない{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-70952dfa1a5ef1fb0232","text":"…まだ何も送ってないんだけど！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4a4b2b2c377e690b7801","text":"車両を撮ってみたんだ、どう？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8cdeede9d4da270c9fac","text":"もう少し絞りを小さくしたほうがいい","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f1b20ef7bea187c0ba83","text":"もう少し絞りを小さくして、できれば露光時間も手動で調整したほうがいいかも","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-77b44fd7cb9e2c9d6ea8","text":"カメラの買い替え時かも","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-27c4fb89ce4d463904ca","text":"[開拓者]って、そんなにカメラに詳しかったんだ！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-b13611a7cb82a6dde711","text":"特に言うことはない","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a03289f7d86d8b35fe88","text":"特に言うことはない","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e169864786e6a7ca673a","text":"ほんと？実はウチもそう思ってたんだよね！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a0edb12570ad2f12be79","text":"でも、あえて悪い点をあげるとすれば………","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ae66fbdfe436e66c3ad0","text":"ウチが写ってないことかな！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-27f07ae6bc51f0c06dec","text":"よし、アンタに決めた！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cf4437fc19dccd3e83d7","text":"[開拓者]、ウチの専属カメラマンになって！","speaker":""}]}
